  &lt;p&gt;Precision before intention&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


.tb-hero h3 { font: 400 38px/1.1 &#x27;Cormorant Garamond&#x27;; }
.tb-hero p { font: italic 500 19px/1.3 &#x27;Cormorant Garamond&#x27;; color: var(--inkSoft); }</code></pre>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="component-row">
