.btn-tertiary { background: transparent; color: var(--inkSoft); font: 500 13px/1 &#x27;EB Garamond&#x27;; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--paperHair); border-radius: 0; }
.is-pressed { transform: scale(0.96); }
.is-disabled { opacity: .4; box-shadow: none; pointer-events: none; }</code></pre>
