  <section id="C7">
    <div class="section-head"><div class="num">§C7</div><div><h2>Drift log v2</h2><div class="rule">Explicit inventory of references, inventions, and known deviations.</div></div></div>
    <table class="log-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Status</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>New visual primitives beyond tokens.css + icons.svg</td><td>None intended</td><td>Components use token colors, token surfaces, token radii/shadows, and icons from ../../icons.svg.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Painterly Tier 1 assets referenced</td><td>Used by cards and thumbnails</td><td>brush-samples/02-ink-pool.png, 05-mist-band.png, 06-layered-ridges.png, 07-asymmetric-branch.png; atmospheric-depth/atmospheric-3-layer.png; atmospheric-depth/atmospheric-5-layer.png.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Format rule</td><td>Kept</td><td>Structural controls use HTML/CSS/SVG references. Ink texture and atmospheric depth are PNG img layers only.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Open question · tertiary button</td><td>Resolved conservatively</td><td>The section text asked for italic tertiary text, but the hard constraint forbids italic button labels. This library keeps the tertiary label upright and flags the conflict here.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Open question · status row</td><td>Resolved conservatively</td><td>The recipe text asked for italic status copy, but the hard constraint says status text is upright. This library keeps status upright.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Icons</td><td>Resolved</td><td>../../icons.svg is available and used for dm-geng, read-elemental, ico-lock, ico-chev-r, ico-empty, ico-edit, and element glyphs.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Sniff-test alignment</td><td>Targeted</td><td>Layout chrome, header system, paper background, token palette, cardstock surfaces, and painterly margins follow legend-v7-ink-wash.html.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>
</main>
</body>
